atory framework\n\n**Activities:**\n- Design system architecture and technical specifications\n- Establish governance structure and stakeholder partnerships\n- Develop data standards and protocols\n- Conduct regional needs assessments in 5 pilot regions\n- Secure initial funding and regulatory approvals\n- Build core team and establish regional coordination centers\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Technical architecture document and prototype\n- Partnership MOUs with 10+ countries/regions\n- Data governance framework\n- Risk assessment and mitigation protocols\n- Funding strategy and initial capital commitments\n- Project governance structure\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Architecture approved by technical advisory board\n- 5+ pilot regions committed with local partners\n- Regulatory pathway established in key jurisdictions\n- Minimum $50M funding secured\n- Core team of 50+ technical and regional experts onboarded\n\n### Phase 2: Platform Core Development (Months 6-18)\n**Purpose:** Build the core technological infrastructure and data processing capabilities\n\n**Activities:**\n- Develop satellite data integration pipeline\n- Build IoT sensor network platform\n- Create AI/ML prediction models\n- Develop community response playbook system\n- Implement data visualization and dashboard\n- Establish cybersecurity and privacy infrastructure\n- Create training and documentation systems\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Satellite analytics platform (test environment)\n- IoT sensor management system\n- Machine learning prediction models (beta)\n- Community response playbook library (25 playbooks)\n- Integrated dashboard prototype\n- Security and privacy compliance framework\n- Training materials and certification programs\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Process 1TB+ of satellite data daily\n- Support 10,000+ IoT sensor connections\n- Achieve 85% accuracy in 7-day climate predictions\n- 500+ community leaders trained\n- Security audit passed with 90+ score\n- Beta testing in 3 regions with positive